# Anthropic 公布的 IPv4。入站 160.79.104.0/23 落在 /21 内；入站另有 153.61.224.0/22，出站另有 153.61.208.0/20
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/21,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,153.61.224.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,153.61.208.0/20,no-resolve
